sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Client as Browser or telephone provider
    participant Entry as Worker or callback gateway
    participant Store as SQLite store
    participant Models as OpenAI / Simli
    participant Tools as Flow / external adapters

    User->>Client: Speak
    alt Browser session
        Client->>Entry: POST /start + SmallWebRTC
    else Telephone session
        Client->>Entry: Signed answer callback
        Entry-->>Client: Media WebSocket instruction
        Client->>Entry: Short-lived-token WebSocket
    end
    Entry->>Store: Load and revalidate graph
    Entry->>Store: Create running session
    loop Conversation turns
        Client->>Entry: Stream audio frames
        Entry->>Models: STT / LLM / TTS or Realtime
        opt Tool-bearing cascade
            Models->>Tools: Confirmed function call
            Tools->>Store: Persist governed result
            Tools-->>Models: Structured status
        end
        Models-->>Client: Stream audio and optional avatar video
        Entry->>Store: Append allowed semantic events
    end
    Entry->>Store: Complete or fail session
